('There is no kind of dishonesty into which otherwise good people more easily and frequently fall than that of defrauding the government.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['good','government']::text[],'5480f5e42ca29db31f15496e05d5e79a57a0e2e7'),
('Lost time is never found again.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['time']::text[],'11e07ea4ae9adea66697141003a9e2693251d6d9'),
('Keep your eyes wide open before marriage, half shut afterwards.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['marriage']::text[],'3c89ae38a1ec039943aae3af6d8ad356722f03be'),
