('Human felicity is produced not as much by great pieces of good fortune that seldom happen as by little advantages that occur every day.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['good','great']::text[],'0ccfb2d68d26b698a4147bf8312fee54bf08d0ff'),
('Necessity never made a good bargain.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['good']::text[],'bc009d3ba55dc7a802ef0c8e627ebb3608d09acb'),
