('In the affairs of this world, men are saved not by faith, but by the want of it.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['faith','men']::text[],'be759c417585d10daa94da076b975f40e2a92d19'),
('Applause waits on success.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['success']::text[],'7b2b680d8de0317683f47c7b42d73a68c48faba5'),
('Hunger is the best pickle.','Benjamin Franklin',ARRAY['best']::text[],'589e8c3e26227fa07e470f739e32617b52153e49'),
