('Let those who, still in their youth, have preserved their faith and fullness of hope, keep looking up.','George A. Smith',ARRAY['faith']::text[],'ba5ae3d8a0b6046bc8344a151917aad826e49010'),
('The time to enjoy a European trip is about three weeks after unpacking.','George Ade',ARRAY['travel']::text[],'64d8793f3a943bfc0a0706034e78f74781ff3ac0'),
('If it were not for the presents, an elopement would be preferable.','George Ade',ARRAY['marriage']::text[],'081688bb446b99329d3c374504788871e28e3193'),
