('To insure peace of mind ignore the rules and regulations.','George Ade',ARRAY['peace']::text[],'0d2215da2f730aef426f5f9b675a958a6f8f9a6f'),
('If we were to wake up some morning and find that everyone was the same race, creed and color, we would find some other causes for prejudice by noon.','George Aiken',ARRAY['morning']::text[],'71bad517d1708865616e17381864dfbc2e5cc2d1'),
('I grew up between the two world wars and received a rather solid general education, the kind middle class children enjoyed in a country whose educational system had its roots dating back to the Austro-Hungarian Monarchy.','George Andrew Olah',ARRAY['dating']::text[],'22aaac62a3fd9cef4ea7472d41dc609c706a5794'),
