('Clever and attractive women do not want to vote they are willing to let men govern as long as they govern men.','George Bernard Shaw',ARRAY['men','women']::text[],'301d5b468331ced63d18f3dd5e49805c396749ec'),
('We have no more right to consume happiness without producing it than to consume wealth without producing it.','George Bernard Shaw',ARRAY['happiness']::text[],'4c9219c2f07e27841319eaf7f45fcaf0216ec436'),
('Marriage is popular because it combines the maximum of temptation with the maximum of opportunity.','George Bernard Shaw',ARRAY['marriage']::text[],'8aa64fe06b097145f7e87ea469044bbe94794d3d'),
