('My reputation grows with every failure.','George Bernard Shaw',ARRAY['failure']::text[],'280581822859621d79f340d98dd6c772186a8147'),
('All my life affection has been showered upon me, and every forward step I have made has been taken in spite of it.','George Bernard Shaw',ARRAY['life']::text[],'93a675d0f7032cebac35ad7b835b1acb5b3bb397'),
