('Life is a lot like jazz... it''s best when you improvise.','George Gershwin',ARRAY['life']::text[],'4787ad5d375c46111483b35abc5e5bdbbecdd427'),
('Intelligent design itself does not have any content.','George Gilder',ARRAY['design']::text[],'c934da19c5b6873d1c698f6b1ef6fb9aa639b800'),
('Have the courage of your desire.','George Gissing',ARRAY['courage']::text[],'2b0fe58432405e54f3e87ddcc8aaa5b7fca68ea9'),
('For the man sound of body and serene of mind there is no such thing as bad weather every day has its beauty, and storms which whip the blood do but make it pulse more vigorously.','George Gissing',ARRAY['beauty']::text[],'9117ab71f9f5f50ef0dacf4cf2b612050d8a4dcb'),
('College is a place to keep warm between high school and an early marriage.','George Gobel',ARRAY['marriage']::text[],'9fc743d57644ca13b692dc7c18cd13b9510a8597'),
('A wise government knows how to enforce with temper, or to conciliate with dignity.','George Grenville',ARRAY['government']::text[],'a2cb4103b8300389a825974498e2bdd5ba58f975'),
('Peace was declared, but not all of us were drunk with joy or stricken blind.','George Grosz',ARRAY['peace']::text[],'2404bfe79fc0ea979615b80277bcd581f662656e'),
