('A man can only attain knowledge with the help of those who possess it. This must be understood from the very beginning. One must learn from him who knows.','George Gurdjieff',ARRAY['knowledge']::text[],'065f3120c5ac2dac6a8372d4613b9c8ca649d7fb'),
('Religion is doing a man does not merely think his religion or feel it, he lives his religion as much as he is able, otherwise it is not religion but fantasy or philosophy.','George Gurdjieff',ARRAY['religion']::text[],'ea71efe3b48e1523df04d8939b2ae95871b40cad'),
('The U.S.S. George H. W. Bush is a great thing in my life. It''s amazing. A great honor.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['amazing']::text[],'944d766e24aef4c4b7de92b26145dfb227e49925'),
('But let me tell you, this gender thing is history. You''re looking at a guy who sat down with Margaret Thatcher across the table and talked about serious issues.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['history']::text[],'4437e856ff264fe9c0c4292e294a9ea7022c0ee8'),
