('I can tell you this: If I''m ever in a position to call the shots, I''m not going to rush to send somebody else''s kids into a war.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['war']::text[],'b31ac16c668a0552884bb4041c44e34de0e8d86f'),
('I hope my own children never have to fight a war.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['hope','war']::text[],'490930545dc315116294e946718d9bd398f467bd'),
