('You cannot be President of the United States if you don''t have faith. Remember Lincoln, going to his knees in times of trial in the Civil War and all that stuff.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['faith','war']::text[],'6474a8c3ea42e95e1dacb204d306717f49d37b24'),
('We can realise a lasting peace and transform the East-West relationship to one of enduring co-operation.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['peace','relationship']::text[],'140c9aea288156c45f18b2887c50f2d4dea4d95e'),
('We know what works. Freedom Works. We know what''s right. Freedom is right.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['freedom']::text[],'c243b793e76ab7ad7f5b42ef8677d3adaefbba0c'),
('One of the good things about the way the Gulf War ended in 1991 is, you''d see the Vietnam veterans marching with the Gulf War veterans.','George H. W. Bush',ARRAY['war']::text[],'5a226b2b69e664ecd1472a119d6b729254425762'),
('Nobody who ever gave his best regretted it.','George Halas',ARRAY['best']::text[],'c73d013db49f0821f968b0fea657c69657f2c4df'),
('Nothing is work unless you''d rather be doing something else.','George Halas',ARRAY['work']::text[],'f905c7bc5d16c5621e46525579487f83f4b9e2a0'),
('The only cure for grief is action.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['sympathy']::text[],'c00e887bc1eb95baf11eb67cc358b9fa7e9c118a'),
('Books minister to our knowledge, to our guidance, and to our delight, by their truth, their uprightness, and their art.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['knowledge']::text[],'c37ce9940924990ad6627dd5405c59cba740d443'),
('Science is the systematic classification of experience.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['science']::text[],'2bb20834dfb312147c1ec2f4287883e8dead89cc'),
('Endeavour to be faithful, and if there is any beauty in your thought, your style will be beautiful if there is any real emotion to express, the expression will be moving.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['beauty']::text[],'0298463ab0a18d31d85001fb27db23de6f75d7bb'),
('Philosophy and Art both render the invisible visible by imagination.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['imagination']::text[],'8641418c9cce2068100fe107eba7ced252b8de15'),
('Insincerity is always weakness sincerity even in error is strength.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['strength']::text[],'c7b661e33fe676a673b1516f5c9c7454493e60b5'),
('The delusions of self-love cannot be prevented, but intellectual misconceptions as to the means of achieving success may be corrected.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['success']::text[],'64a1578e566300a151105621d02d555c62c64115'),
('Science is not addressed to poets.','George Henry Lewes',ARRAY['science']::text[],'fdf865678d34ab9c15182c6c7bd69205589a5511'),
