('There''s a victory, and defeat the first and best of victories, the lowest and worst of defeats which each man gains or sustains at the hands not of another, but of himself.','Plato',ARRAY['best']::text[],'9983863d069dc7df6e111799a44f8fec76ae320d'),
('Human behavior flows from three main sources: desire, emotion, and knowledge.','Plato',ARRAY['knowledge']::text[],'9d96d4333ad1f7271da6230ab0fbe6883e9df147'),
