('Any man may easily do harm, but not every man can do good to another.','Plato',ARRAY['good']::text[],'0ea4f568cf9d9f57dd77acde10b2bb185424b1ad'),
('Ignorance of all things is an evil neither terrible nor excessive, nor yet the greatest of all but great cleverness and much learning, if they be accompanied by a bad training, are a much greater misfortune.','Plato',ARRAY['great','learning']::text[],'a5bc4ece5bf7ef73cd94c1f96c1f3f0b76be0b77'),
