('No man should bring children into the world who is unwilling to persevere to the end in their nature and education.','Plato',ARRAY['education','nature']::text[],'45bf911b66860423d00ff346151f09e84b4a4997'),
('For good nurture and education implant good constitutions.','Plato',ARRAY['education','good']::text[],'6fb9af602210dbb0e99a57f67cc8f06c409ae9ae'),
('No one is a friend to his friend who does not love in return.','Plato',ARRAY['love']::text[],'06c3a025eafab0432540cd7b66dc97ee79816b8a'),
('He who is not a good servant will not be a good master.','Plato',ARRAY['good']::text[],'ce1884a06c28560bb919deb9c98e7edf9b26d887'),
('I never did anything worth doing by accident, nor did any of my inventions come by accident they came by work.','Plato',ARRAY['work']::text[],'6006cc3a09b7613f2558f5c89592617a772b1093'),
('To prefer evil to good is not in human nature and when a man is compelled to choose one of two evils, no one will choose the greater when he might have the less.','Plato',ARRAY['good','nature']::text[],'ccfd58ec73035c1eee61cb87ec5157c921e9645a'),
('The direction in which education starts a man will determine his future in life.','Plato',ARRAY['education','future','life']::text[],'130e5b28bef4af340d389a4a2ed826f93d01efb8'),
('Wisdom alone is the science of other sciences.','Plato',ARRAY['alone','science','wisdom']::text[],'31097b3c90af5a141f27261cd21c554f355fece1'),
('Courage is knowing what not to fear.','Plato',ARRAY['courage','fear']::text[],'cb13ff62e27e933ee2136e6b64a88362b8da116a'),
('The good is the beautiful.','Plato',ARRAY['good']::text[],'ffa9ad9a1d886065f1a8cb7450360473c1c5041b'),
