('We ought to fly away from earth to heaven as quickly as we can and to fly away is to become like God, as far as this is possible and to become like him is to become holy, just, and wise.','Plato',ARRAY['god']::text[],'f6da1eb7923af0fbe02976fb6bb7171602b19cb2'),
('Our object in the construction of the state is the greatest happiness of the whole, and not that of any one class.','Plato',ARRAY['happiness']::text[],'690a9d065bf777f8db8af2f74467509069fa2400'),
