('Do the thing we fear, and death of fear is certain.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['death','fear']::text[],'8deec1d73b7eef1b00b7f225ca8ca820d49c6920'),
('Nature always wears the colors of the spirit.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature']::text[],'f2de503d95845924877118292c937632d17719c1'),
('Nature and books belong to the eyes that see them.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature','wisdom']::text[],'13abf742f2939620b179fdd8c84cfafae5e1cb1c'),
('Shallow men believe in luck. Strong men believe in cause and effect.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['men','strength']::text[],'da3066303022f718b67208486b93e09892806b77'),
('The revelation of thought takes men out of servitude into freedom.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['freedom','men']::text[],'2c97650c9286777dd9c687d12e9958c43cd01fd2'),
