('Don''t be too timid and squeamish about your actions. All life is an experiment.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['life']::text[],'d753146f6ce5664fd6b4dcca635f214aa8c5e289'),
('A friend may well be reckoned the masterpiece of nature.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['friendship','nature']::text[],'b4da04a29ae9ec6f7d3abfa2ab529741b2365d66'),
