('Nature is a mutable cloud which is always and never the same.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature']::text[],'a8757752fc83da596a0f32b2f85c5b3a43a2672a'),
('Nature hates calculators.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature']::text[],'62f3c13c34acc67073594937c44a6aaf0b926441'),
