('Fear defeats more people than any other one thing in the world.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['fear']::text[],'3821855276da141f0513d4ac835ea5b43daa1e14'),
('The real and lasting victories are those of peace, and not of war.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['peace','war']::text[],'976a2caf66e8ab1ef1ab7be10c32491a7084f91c'),
