('Money often costs too much.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['money']::text[],'2bdd174a912bfce773f851af7f6746231c6bae16'),
('Write it on your heart that every day is the best day in the year.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['best','newyears']::text[],'389a9046400588da25e00f36e5db4cabe5bb875c'),
('Common sense is genius dressed in its working clothes.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['intelligence']::text[],'9ed60f62b13ee5cea284ae6b924a015adcf2dfcb'),
('Nobody can bring you peace but yourself.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['peace']::text[],'a968d1df18ebb6cbb3a8958efb11410e56ab7d38'),
('In the morning a man walks with his whole body in the evening, only with his legs.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['morning']::text[],'428c030b7c74ffb39fc600058de3931fd9978dc1'),
('A chief event of life is the day in which we have encountered a mind that startled us.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['life']::text[],'6702144d6bb976668bd15db6b02d430d42e04b8d'),
