('Every artist was first an amateur.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['art']::text[],'6837231fafe3d1547e1a6aafadc9a284cee6f531'),
('Men are what their mothers made them.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['men','mom']::text[],'99d1cbefbfbd923b9eb0a1d829a9e78bad6f855d'),
