('We acquire the strength we have overcome.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['strength']::text[],'1427c1285a93f34743299b281440327a403060e5'),
('Power and speed be hands and feet.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['power']::text[],'5f3f00ee8d056c28d9a663ec924814486eff611a'),
