('Men''s actions are too strong for them. Show me a man who has acted, and who has not been the victim and slave of his action.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['men']::text[],'87f98c76dbec7d0ea3d363b906886b90cc40f36d'),
('Every known fact in natural science was divined by the presentiment of somebody, before it was actually verified.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['science']::text[],'9e0fe715401a9c446752ea6cbfa03760cd9f80a6'),
('Every man has his own courage, and is betrayed because he seeks in himself the courage of other persons.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['courage']::text[],'270bcf3b5ce2c854c63b4aff17736679ec51c734'),
('In every society some men are born to rule, and some to advise.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['men','society']::text[],'92b0abb5a95c76883ea07f9c2cffbc17ca4f8a0f'),
('Flowers... are a proud assertion that a ray of beauty outvalues all the utilities of the world.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['beauty']::text[],'157a27c14b644529d277cbac95bbdb192134785b'),
('A man''s growth is seen in the successive choirs of his friends.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['friendship']::text[],'3532286779f195628130f581b6ac005f64a1c5ae'),
('Death comes to all, but great achievements build a monument which shall endure until the sun grows cold.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['death','great']::text[],'5c7a236fe8bb77c5778eecef5e7f778b455d5f4c'),
