('Fiction reveals truth that reality obscures.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['truth']::text[],'e90420082436c41a9aba09aa1c31f52c0390073a'),
('The value of a dollar is social, as it is created by society.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['society']::text[],'9bdffd541e97486415d95ef42fa4d65182cacb30'),
('No great man ever complains of want of opportunity.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great']::text[],'f4f7692643a024a085bc52d73ef2781e5e66ac14'),
('We are by nature observers, and thereby learners. That is our permanent state.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature']::text[],'ea3a15c34a00129dc323efbdf6c9fc3aa4b617f2'),
('Earth laughs in flowers.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature']::text[],'d38623d30964d8e92c23eae6f70c36a37334ca0e'),
('No man ever prayed heartily without learning something.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['learning']::text[],'73975bd25d1ade036c669d6d7334f07f3ee04645'),
('For every minute you remain angry, you give up sixty seconds of peace of mind.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['anger','peace']::text[],'86afd917820a37b4257fea8a57ae226e979903f4'),
('The best effort of a fine person is felt after we have left their presence.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['best']::text[],'6654fd423a92444951edf5fef43a28b0551fc306'),
('The greatest glory in living lies not in never falling, but in rising every time we fall.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['time']::text[],'86247e3c2402e340e974d3fd58c44359d19a399b'),
('The highest revelation is that God is in every man.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['god']::text[],'2ab0d6263d843e55dfa5c811fbb3f0e4f1c3ecb6')
INSERT INTO quotes_library (quote, author, tags, quote_hash) VALUES
('The first wealth is health.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['fitness','health']::text[],'3e2f464b1c36273b1acc2d6f01c76eb400fde85b'),
('Before we acquire great power we must acquire wisdom to use it well.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great','power','wisdom']::text[],'7ff6f62b5ef2322e54f9ba251df6873c55af8a2d'),
('Judge of your natural character by what you do in your dreams.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['dreams']::text[],'b6d971101a8ba2743941bc9f37dd17d721acc37e'),
('People with great gifts are easy to find, but symmetrical and balanced ones never.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great']::text[],'68e5dde18148857320b43520b9a8070acdce0633'),
('As we grow old, the beauty steals inward.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['beauty']::text[],'cdb87fb47cb351c88e1818a660e3f3b5714a5085'),
('It is a fact often observed, that men have written good verses under the inspiration of passion, who cannot write well under other circumstances.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['good','men']::text[],'e427c09965949c3b41c5bbebf695f7c63d22445b'),
('The health of the eye seems to demand a horizon. We are never tired, so long as we can see far enough.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['health']::text[],'7a754de475d4d42e2a9f6c1186644404eb6725c4'),
('Great hearts steadily send forth the secret forces that incessantly draw great events.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great']::text[],'ba6e3a84c9aedc419b21efdc9d8e1fdd5e4b71dc'),
('As soon as there is life there is danger.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['life']::text[],'7c27ad7508a1ab47be4146e0587a784c6c488856'),
('Life consists in what a man is thinking of all day.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['life']::text[],'50291dbfbe79b167d7a7b0cee4f0ad733905767c'),
('Wisdom has its root in goodness, not goodness its root in wisdom.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['wisdom']::text[],'339ea267e74dc78b362461245329e5f631d0959b'),
('There is a blessed necessity by which the interest of men is always driving them to the right and, again, making all crime mean and ugly.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['men']::text[],'603dc37ae2c2a5eebcb8651d475e2f9fe6fb3586'),
('Trust men and they will be true to you treat them greatly and they will show themselves great.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great','men','trust']::text[],'4c71483ea9c9107dd868d28dd87a961a5c4e7854'),
('All mankind love a lover.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['love']::text[],'faeb9e300d78759f01c8deba6adfad4fa594d89c'),
('The invariable mark of wisdom is to see the miraculous in the common.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['wisdom']::text[],'100013efed19825fcf4f6e12a0260a774bc05885'),
('God screens us evermore from premature ideas.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['god']::text[],'ed443e35a68c54391e3bf79bc5a37b8066c641d5'),
('Little minds have little worries, big minds have no time for worries.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['time']::text[],'11399c6f639df5e116cdc7ea216e96c29d4d9925'),
('Beauty without grace is the hook without the bait.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['beauty']::text[],'84b745260b9e6a356accd1ccdc0a1182edb74909'),
('Great geniuses have the shortest biographies.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great']::text[],'1552e71511ad88f44dff7e89685a993eeccc251e'),
('Pictures must not be too picturesque.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['art']::text[],'a559e75b3615575b7b63aa0b93ef78bf9d884b17'),
('Great men are they who see that spiritual is stronger than any material force - that thoughts rule the world.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great','men']::text[],'7599305ce29205056bcc728eba197bb8ae81bb76'),
('Knowledge is knowing that we cannot know.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['knowledge']::text[],'0de28492752e090c81cad94e7e012186bbe11fc0'),
