('When nature has work to be done, she creates a genius to do it.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature','work']::text[],'81ae6bb0af852bdedaeaf23e64928aa0e6482504'),
('Great men or men of great gifts you shall easily find, but symmetrical men never.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great','men']::text[],'444810c6f4f14198116f0f7fb20af924c5cb2187'),
