('The method of nature: who could ever analyze it?','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['nature']::text[],'42b485f77f70f11b2ee0048f7b46e7c60773670d'),
('Beauty without expression is boring.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['beauty']::text[],'f5e6d3978ffe1c8b74718cc7c2e700b7ecf003ff'),
('Bad times have a scientific value. These are occasions a good learner would not miss.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['good','science']::text[],'10120ba169bf1edad9ba5a979857f19ac4178ea2'),
