('To be great is to be misunderstood.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great']::text[],'4f180d42bf341206a4f13f665716b8e81b4469a8'),
('Our faith comes in moments our vice is habitual.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['faith']::text[],'de9c4516eb8dae94f89416f8f6a771c46f9eab54'),
('Our greatest glory is not in never failing, but in rising up every time we fail.','Ralph Waldo Emerson',ARRAY['great','time']::text[],'7d9b312d1866212c8a7741d85f9df62b08a7ec52'),
