('There have been many great men that have flattered the people who ne''er loved them.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['great','men']::text[],'eda5944a3412e4d3b8445228fbe677bc811ae163'),
('I bear a charmed life.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['life']::text[],'e91f3a49822189fa7fd939558f3d945b53573fc8'),
