('But men are men the best sometimes forget.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['best','men']::text[],'30f983aba91bf5f2e5b890db5aff6dc836cb4c8b'),
('An overflow of good converts to bad.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['good']::text[],'88f509c52e80f0add1fc9a105d3e3c54936f2162'),
