('Speak low, if you speak love.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['love']::text[],'8a8caa688932be0b35a0fd7243d8fed1523a04e2'),
('And this, our life, exempt from public haunt, finds tongues in trees, books in the running brooks, sermons in stones, and good in everything.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['good','life','nature']::text[],'fde307dfe3cf86f79c5f3ac8b667e92c3b3d7248'),
('A peace is of the nature of a conquest for then both parties nobly are subdued, and neither party loser.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['nature','peace']::text[],'a284d8967053253d7c56bc4f692c4210c7317077'),
('What a piece of work is a man, how noble in reason, how infinite in faculties, in form and moving how express and admirable, in action how like an angel, in apprehension how like a god.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['god','work']::text[],'41bfb4342a028d6f41e647e4247215d4e3c781c1'),
('Love is not love that alters when it alteration finds.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['love']::text[],'e20c2706ba187b780064106fba335c18f0bbada1'),
