('Who could refrain that had a heart to love and in that heart courage to make love known?','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['courage','love']::text[],'f6c8aaa54c3a1e97d2e15478a0fb5c8774734a8c'),
('When we are born we cry that we are come to this great stage of fools.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['great']::text[],'e1eadb8ed9083825522ffb4706779e0b23cc8049'),
('Things done well and with a care, exempt themselves from fear.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['fear']::text[],'c9dc5c473ab42cfec470f519cf9347f6ab9a3b19'),
('The love of heaven makes one heavenly.','William Shakespeare',ARRAY['love']::text[],'2c452af6defc26e31c73a5df944e9b9643af030e'),
